Hi,

to make participation by phone as easy as possible, please make your 
slides available as PDF file as soon as possible. Either attach them to 
the OpenPrinting Summit web page by yourself and add a link to the 
appropriate session or simply send them to me.

To add them by yourself you need a Linux Foundation account and if you 
did not do so yet you must join the OpenPrinting group with it. I will 
accept new group members as quick as possible. If I do not accept one or 
another quickly, send me an e-mail, as some user names do not tell me 
who you are.

Do not link the slides from an external server.

The slides are used for two things:

1. On the computer from where we do the projection and the screencast 
presentation we download the PDFs with your slides.

2. If phone participants have problems with the screencast or if they 
want to have a copy of the slides where one can navigate manually, they 
download the PDFs with your slides.

So please send or post your slides as soon as possible, best before the 
Summit, but at least before your session.

Also please send mail if you have special technical requirements for 
your presentation (speakers, wired network, ...).

    Till
